    <div class="head"><h2>Four ways to work with us</h2><p>Day rates plus VAT and agreed travel, with a fixed number of days quoted for each piece of work so there are no surprises.</p></div>
    <div class="grid g4">
      <div class="tile tile-dark"><h3>A fixed-scope review</h3><p>One question, one price, six to twelve weeks. The most common starting point.</p></div>
      <div class="tile tile-dark"><h3>A project</h3><p>A Theory of Change, an income strategy, an options appraisal or a piece of research, delivered as a defined package.</p></div>
      <div class="tile tile-dark"><h3>Interim or fractional</h3><p>A chief executive, development or marketing director for two to three days a week, on site and remote, for a defined period.</p></div>
      <div class="tile tile-dark"><h3>A retained critical friend</h3><p>A few days a quarter for a chair or chief executive who wants someone independent to think with.</p></div>
